              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "34:22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.16.9+DEU.16.10+DEU.16.11+DEU.16.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bir 16:9-12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kandi mutandike kubara okuruga ha kiro ekirukukurata Sabbato, okuruga ha kiro eki mwaleetiireho ekiba ky'ekihongwa eky'okwimukyaimukya; zihike wiiki musanju, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mubale ebiro makumi ataano okuhika ha kiro ekirukukurata Sabbato; eya musanju, muleetere MUKAMA ekihongwa eky'ebyokulya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buli ka ereete emigaati ebiri ey'okwimukyaimukya, enyakucumbirwe omu nsaano enyakuniinuukire, erukuhikya kiloguraamu ibiri; emigaati egi, etumbisibwe; ebe muganuro gwa MUKAMA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emigaati egi, ogihonge n'ebyaana by'entaama musanju eby'omwaka gumu kandi ebitanyina kamogo, enimi ento emu, n'empaya ibiri ez'entaama; ebi byona bibe kihongwa kya MUKAMA, bihongerwe hamu n'ekihongwa eky'ebyokulya, n'ebihongwa byabo eby'ekyokunywa, obyokye harugemu ekisorrokoko ekirungi ekirukusemeza MUKAMA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ohonge empaya ey'emburabuzi, kibe kihongwa eky'okuganyiza ebibi, ebihaya bibiri eby'entaama eby'omwaka gumu bibe kyonzira habw'okusaba obusinge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebi byona, nyakatagara abiimukyaimukize hamu n'emigaati ey'omuganuro, bibe kihongwa eky'okwimukiza MUKAMA; bintu birukwera bya MUKAMA kandi mugabo gwa nyakatagara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
