            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA yagambira Musa ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Gambira abantu ba Isirairi ngu: ha kiro kya ikumi na bitaano eky'okwezi kunu, okwa musanju, kiraabaga kiro ky'obugenyi bwa MUKAMA obw'ensiisira, obugenyi obu, buraamaraga ebiro musanju. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha kiro eky'okubanza, mwesoroozeege kuramya; mutalikora mulimo gwona ogw'amaani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebiro musanju, mubimalege nimuhongera MUKAMA, ebihongwa eby'okwokya; ha kiro ekya munaana, mwesoroozeege muramye, muhongere MUKAMA ekihongwa eky'okwokya, mwesorooze muramye; mutalikora mulimo gw'amaani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Obu nubwo bugenyi bwa MUKAMA obwaragiirwe, obu muraarangira abantu nkooku buli nubwo busumi obw'okwesorooza kuramya, nuko kasumi ak'okuheeraho MUKAMA ebihongwa eby'okwokya, n'ebihongwa eby'ebyokulya ebyonzira n'ebihongwa eby'okunywa, buli kimu nikiheebwayo ha kiro kyakyo ekinyakuhikire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hali ebi, oyongereho Sabbato za MUKAMA, ebisembo byawe, ebihongwa eby'okuhikiriza ebi waraganiize n'ebisembo eby'okwegondeza ebi oha MUKAMA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ha kiro ekya ikumi na bitaano eky'okwezi kwa musanju, obu muraabaga mumazire kuhunika ebi mwereze, muteekege obugenyi bwa MUKAMA okumara ebiro musanju; ekiro eky'okubanza n'ekiro kya munaana; biraabaga by'okuhuumura. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha kiro eky'okubanza, mukwate ebijuma eby'emiti emirungi, amataagi g'enkindo, ag'emiti enyakujumbire n'emikinga eya ha myegeego ey'ebisaaru; musemererwe, muguruke omumaiso ga MUKAMA Ruhanga wanyu okumara ebiro musanju. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obugenyi bwa MUKAMA obu, mubuteekege buli mwaka okumara ebiro musanju, eki kiragiro kyanyu eky'ebiro byona; mubuteekege omu kwezi kwa musanju. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:42"
          },
